        for v in nums:
            # Candidates i with nums[i] < v form a prefix of the sorted stack.
            ans += bisect_left(st, v)
            # Keep only candidates with value <= v (they survive for future j),
            # then add current index as a candidate.
            while st and st[-1] > v:
                st.pop()
            st.append(v)
        return ans
```